T*
(   4. Ring Topology:) Tj
T*
(   - Link Complexity: Each node connects to exactly two adjacent neighbors forming a closed loop;) Tj
T*
(   requires n links.) Tj
T*
(   - Cable Length & Cost: Moderate cabling; deterministic token-passing protocol prevents packet) Tj
T*
(   collisions.) Tj
T*
(   - Fault Tolerance: Inherently low in unidirectional rings \(a break anywhere disrupts token) Tj
T*
(   circulation\).) Tj
T*
(   - Failure Impact: In modern implementations, dual counter-rotating fiber rings \(e.g., FDDI,) Tj
T*
(   SONET\) provide self-healing automatic loopback reconfiguration upon cable cuts.) Tj
T*
